{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/cb5164b235d4c0f2fa400ab9e72351ce.avif?t=1761558644\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo is an experience that gives you a taste of the game's characters, biomes, cards, story and companions.\u00a0</strong><br><br><br>Enter a captivating realm steeped in the exotic and bizarre tapestry of Japanese mythology with Talespinner, a deck-building roguelike adventure. As the storyteller, you will guide your chosen hero through an ever-changing narrative shaped by your decisions and deck construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/03ea53225383992a4b6dc9b0906cc95d.webp?t=1761558644\" width=240 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/e15f00cac437ec33fb59d3e3c9aaf1a9.poster.avif?t=1761558644\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/e15f00cac437ec33fb59d3e3c9aaf1a9.webm?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/e15f00cac437ec33fb59d3e3c9aaf1a9.mp4?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every story needs a hero. Select from 3 unique characters, each with distinct gameplay mechanics and a powerful set of cards that can be upgraded as you play. Forge powerful card synergies to dominate the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/5cb1b4412ef92c341f7357dcbc6f170b.webp?t=1761558644\" width=288 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/d26bb076325d7f151523676c5338befb.poster.avif?t=1761558644\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/d26bb076325d7f151523676c5338befb.webm?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/d26bb076325d7f151523676c5338befb.mp4?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide what adventure your hero will embark on. Are they being pursued by a ninja clan led by the famous Hanzo Hattori? Or perhaps they venture into the mountains to track down the Ice Lady, Yuki Onna, who haunts the local population there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scenario offers additional story twists, adding layers of challenge and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/94b8ea602ed7b0a932df81649876795c.webp?t=1761558644\" width=258 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/ae78601b5af7b2657e73db952bcc9141.poster.avif?t=1761558644\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/ae78601b5af7b2657e73db952bcc9141.webm?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/ae78601b5af7b2657e73db952bcc9141.mp4?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your storybook to dictate the hero's encounters. Modify challenges to your liking \u2013 make them easier to progress or increase the stakes for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/bbd87a79f12fc6ab3a0a59a7e5d5a7a8.webp?t=1761558644\" width=370 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/12e7935b2d7b003ece9cee08c41a5cb0.poster.avif?t=1761558644\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/12e7935b2d7b003ece9cee08c41a5cb0.webm?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/12e7935b2d7b003ece9cee08c41a5cb0.mp4?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of creatures from Japanese mythology. Each yokai comes with its own diverse set of skills making every encounter unique challenge. How to deal with them is up to you. Crush them in decisive combat or make them your allies through charm and cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/eb153d7cb202456bbd7eab5d5d4c1db1.webp?t=1761558644\" width=461 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/6f4dc13f66e657070d84d24502f1cc24.poster.avif?t=1761558644\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/6f4dc13f66e657070d84d24502f1cc24.webm?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/6f4dc13f66e657070d84d24502f1cc24.mp4?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront various hostile forces in battle, which can affect the actions of your hero's cards, enhancing immersion and further increasing the strategic aspect of combat with each opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/cd02cd65d9f67b49b94f406d328ba8af.webp?t=1761558644\" width=571 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/4879d2e7725afb9296bfa41401ad3422.poster.avif?t=1761558644\" width=620 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/4879d2e7725afb9296bfa41401ad3422.webm?t=1761558644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take an epic journey through various biomes like bamboo forests, mysterious caves, windy plains, haunted villages, temples and many more. Each biome offers diverse events and as well as unique set of enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039370/extras/8ff6c5cb30cc831df1aceb970c3db971.poste